					"content": "现在在做的事就是「留影」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170402,
					"content": "嗯，不错，又学到新东西了。快开始吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
